      "merge": "<p>You gain Resistance to <strong>air</strong> and <strong>bolt</strong> damage.</p><p>You may use an action to accurately predict weather conditions for the next day within a range of <strong>2 travel days</strong>. The Game Master will tell you what the weather conditions will be.</p>",
